{"source":"e4af8e4f8e8247d0bf167e23b4a8f1bc","folderId":"e89183df3b414e4eb21b690ed437f77a","values":{"fullAppSettings":true,"basemapGalleryConfig":{"basemapIdsToFilter":[]},"searchConfiguration":{"searchAllEnabled":false,"allPlaceholder":"Kelder, adres of plaats zoeken","sources":[{"_uid":"ea32beea165","url":"https://geocoder.arcgisonline.nl/arcgis/rest/services/Geocoder_NL_RD/GeocodeServer","singleLineFieldName":"SingleLine","name":"Esri Nederland Geocoder","placeholder":"Adres of plaats zoeken","maxResults":6,"maxSuggestions":6,"suggestionsEnabled":true,"minSuggestCharacters":1,"withinViewEnabled":false,"countryCode":"","zoomScale":null}],"activeSourceIndex":0},"title":"Ontheffing speedpedelec","customHeader":false,"splash":false,"sidebarExpanded":true,"activePanel":"details","layerListPanel":true,"bookmarksPanel":false,"layerEditPanel":false,"detailsContent":"<h2>Ontheffing speedpedelec</h2><p>Speedpedelec met ontheffing, bij deelnemende gemeenten of wegbeheerders in groen:</p><ul><li>binnen en buiten de bebouwde kom toegestaan op fietspaden (G11 en G13)* met maximumsnelheid van 30 km/u<br>G11 <img src=\"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/f4472d22cf5f4d0c9f1cd6a53ddc138f/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1712518152592_detailsContent_textEditor_1712518152273.png\" alt=\"G11.png\"> &nbsp;en G13 <img src=\"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/f4472d22cf5f4d0c9f1cd6a53ddc138f/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1712518166574_detailsContent_textEditor_1712518166462.png\" alt=\"G13.png\"></li></ul><p><br>De ontheffing geldt niet voor paden en wegen met het onderbord ‘Uitgezonderd fietsers’(OB52), ‘Fietsers toegestaan’.</p><p>OB52 <img src=\"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/f4472d22cf5f4d0c9f1cd6a53ddc138f/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1712518187956_detailsContent_textEditor_1712518187842.png\" alt=\"OB52.png\"></p><p>* = met uitzondering van de fietspaden die op de kaart in rood zijn gemarkeerd.</p><p>De gemeente Utrecht doet haar best om de informatie op deze kaart kloppend en actueel te houden. Komt u iets tegen wat niet klopt of sterk verouderd is, dan vinden wij het fijn als u ons dat laat weten. Dat kan via ons <a href=\"https://www.utrecht.nl/reactieformulier\" target=\"_blank\">reactieformulier</a> of bel 14 030.</p>","filterPanel":false,"basemapGallery":false,"enableFeatureSearchScale":false,"popupHover":false,"compassWidget":false,"locateWidget":true,"measure":false,"keyboardShortcuts":true,"disableScroll":false,"scalebarDualMode":false,"extentSelector":false,"enableHighlightColor":true,"enableHighlightHaloColor":true,"basemapToggle":false,"share":false,"customUrlParam":{"layers":[]},"panelSize":"m","theme":"light","customTheme":{"applySharedTheme":false,"applyPresetTheme":true,"font":"Arial","appFont":"Arial","logo":"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/c88735ccb5394943907969a17cce05a8/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1712215481313_Utrecht_Logo.png","logoLink":"https://www.utrecht.nl/","logoScale":"m","preset":null,"themes":{"primary":{"type":"primary","background":"#FFFFFF","text":"#000000"},"secondary":{"type":"secondary","background":"#FFFFFF","text":"#000000"},"accent":{"type":"accent","background":"#2964A3","text":"#ffffff"}}},"uploads":["https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/f4472d22cf5f4d0c9f1cd6a53ddc138f/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1712517837804_detailsContent_textEditor_1712517837630.png","https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/f4472d22cf5f4d0c9f1cd6a53ddc138f/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1712517837874_detailsContent_textEditor_1712517837672.png","https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/f4472d22cf5f4d0c9f1cd6a53ddc138f/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1712517837977_detailsContent_textEditor_1712517837696.png","https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/f4472d22cf5f4d0c9f1cd6a53ddc138f/resources/media/i